        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mogens Palle, Ken Buchanan, Carlos Monzon, Larry Holmes, Emile Griffith, John Conteh\n- Roles: boxing promoter, manager, professional boxer, world champion\n- Places: Denmark, Edinburgh\n\nFacts:\n- Mogens Palle was born on 14 March 1934.\n- Ken Buchanan was born on 28 June 1945.\n- Mogens Palle is a Danish professional boxing promoter and manager.\n- Mogens Palle brought boxing stars Carlos Monzon, Larry Holmes, Emile Griffith, Ken Buchanan, and John Conteh to Denmark.\n- Ken Buchanan is a British retired professional boxer from Edinburgh.\n- Ken Buchanan is a former Undisputed World Lightweight Champion.",
